            "detailed_description": "Super Tony Land is the story of Tony, a plumber from Brooklyn doing his best to make a living in the Videogame Realm.<br><br>Build your own Levels and link them together to create Worlds, Characters, Stories and Challenges. Explore the Multiverse and find new adventures.<br><br>Use Tronics, a visual programing language, and physics to build almost anything you can dream up. From robots or rocketships, to dialog trees for telling complex stories. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Side Scrolling Platformer<br></li><li>Crazy Power Ups<br></li><li>Powerful Level Editor<br></li><li>Physics Based Construction<br></li><li>Dynamic Lighting on Sprites<br></li><li>Visual Programing Language<br></li><li>Character Creation<br></li><li>Link Levels to build whole Worlds!<br></li><li>Share Worlds over Steam Workshop<br></li><li>Find countless new adventures to play!</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "Super Tony Land is the story of Tony, a plumber from Brooklyn doing his best to make a living in the Videogame Realm.<br><br>Build your own Levels and link them together to create Worlds, Characters, Stories and Challenges. Explore the Multiverse and find new adventures.<br><br>Use Tronics, a visual programing language, and physics to build almost anything you can dream up. From robots or rocketships, to dialog trees for telling complex stories. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Side Scrolling Platformer<br></li><li>Crazy Power Ups<br></li><li>Powerful Level Editor<br></li><li>Physics Based Construction<br></li><li>Dynamic Lighting on Sprites<br></li><li>Visual Programing Language<br></li><li>Character Creation<br></li><li>Link Levels to build whole Worlds!<br></li><li>Share Worlds over Steam Workshop<br></li><li>Find countless new adventures to play!</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Super Tony Land is a platformer with a powerful level editor and an emphasis on telling stories and building entire game worlds.",
